#: src/VocabularyManager/MainWindow.cpp
msgid "The file was not found. The vocabulary folder may still be syncing."
msgstr "找不到檔案，詞庫資料夾可能還在同步"

#: src/VocabularyManager/MainWindow.cpp
msgid "The file could not be written."
msgstr "無法寫入檔案。"

#: src/VocabularyManager/MainWindow.cpp
msgid ""
"The input method has not run yet, so the vocabulary can only be viewed. "
"Switch to McBopomofo once, then open this window again."
msgstr "輸入法還沒啟動過，詞彙只能瀏覽。請先切換到小麥注音一次，再重新開啟此視窗。"

#: src/McBopomofo.cpp
msgid "Manage Vocabulary…"
msgstr "管理詞彙…"

#: src/VocabularyManager/MainWindow.cpp
msgid "English Words"
msgstr "英文詞彙"

#: src/VocabularyManager/MainWindow.cpp
msgid "Common Sentences"
msgstr "常用句"

#: src/VocabularyManager/MainWindow.cpp
msgid "Temporary Phrases"
msgstr "暫存詞"

#: src/VocabularyManager/MainWindow.cpp
msgid ""
"Words typed twice or more, or added here, come first in the English "
"completions with Tab."
msgstr "打過兩次以上或在這裡加入的英文字，按 Tab 英文聯想時排在最前面。"

#: src/VocabularyManager/MainWindow.cpp
msgid ""
"A sentence sent three times is remembered, and the rest of it is suggested "
"after typing its beginning, to be taken with Tab. Sentences added here are "
"remembered at once and never forgotten."
msgstr ""
"同一句送出三次就會記住，之後打出開頭會提示後半句，按 Tab 接上。在這裡加入的句"
"子立即生效、不會被遺忘。"

#: src/VocabularyManager/MainWindow.cpp
msgid ""
"Phrases picked once come first for 30 days, and are added to the Chinese "
"phrases when typed again."
msgstr "手動選過一次的詞，30 天內優先出現；再打出來送出一次就加入中文詞彙。"

